@startuml RF41_Classes
title RF41 — Ganhar FAI Points em todos os jogos (FLAIR e Desafios) e ao criar esquemas e peças\nDiagrama de classes — quem chama FaiPointsService.game()/award(), eventos de criação e regras (V5 + V26)
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #F4F2EF
  BorderColor #4A4852
  ArrowColor #4A4852
  HeaderBackgroundColor #E4DEF0
}
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide empty methods
hide empty fields

package "fai-application · jogos" {
  class FlairService <<@Service>> {
    +duel(user, schemeId, opponent): Map  «faiPoints»
    +joinArena(user, schemeId): Map
    +teamBattle(user, code): Map  «faiPoints»
    +claimQuest(user, code): Map
    ~award(userId, coins, rankPoints, reason, ref): boolean  «FLAIR Coins»
  }
  class FlairModesService <<@Service>> {
    +MODES: List<Mode>  «15 modos»
    ~REWARDED_PER_MODE_DAY = 3  «coins»
    ~finish(user, mode, theme, winner, result, …): Map  «faiPoints»
  }
  class ChallengeService <<@Service>> {
    +submitEntry(user, id, schemeId): Map
    ~reward(participant, instance, template, pts)
  }
}

package "fai-application · criações" {
  class SchemeService <<@Service>> {
    +create(user, SchemeForm): Map  «SchemeSaved(created = true)»
  }
  class WardrobeService <<@Service>> {
    +create(user, PieceForm)  «PieceCreated»
    +update(user, id, form)  «PieceUpdated»
    +addToWardrobe(user, sourceId)  «cópia: sem evento»
  }
  class Model3dService <<@Service>> {
    job do 3D concluído → awardIsolated(PIECE_3D)
  }
  class WardrobeEventListeners <<@Component>> {
    +onSchemeSaved(SchemeSaved)
    +onPieceCreated(PieceCreated)
    +onPieceUpdated(PieceUpdated)
    +onModel3d(Model3dGenerated)  «sem publicador»
  }
  class InventoryScoreService {
    +{static} catalogReady(w): boolean  «≥ 60%, foto real»
    +{static} completeness(w): int
  }
}

package "fai-application · eventos" {
  class "DomainEvents.SchemeSaved" as SchemeSaved <<record>> {
    userId, schemeId: UUID
    pieceIds: List<UUID>
    origin: String
    created: boolean
  }
  class "DomainEvents.PieceCreated" as PieceCreated <<record>> {
    userId, pieceId: UUID
    readyForCatalog: boolean
  }
  class "DomainEvents.PieceUpdated" as PieceUpdated <<record>> {
    userId, pieceId: UUID
    completeness: int
  }
}

package "fai-application · pontos" {
  class FaiPointsService <<@Service>> {
    +game(userId, game, matchRef, outcome): int
    +award(userId, actionCode, refType, refId, pointsOverride): Award
    +awardIsolated(…): Award  «REQUIRES_NEW»
  }
  class "FaiPointsService.Award" as Award <<record>> {
    granted: boolean
    points: int
    capReached: boolean
    message: String
    level: Level
    levelUp: boolean
  }
}

package "fai-domain" {
  class FaiPointsRule <<@Entity>> {
    actionCode: String «PK»
    points: int
    dailyCap: Integer
    weeklyCap: Integer
    oncePerRef: boolean
    active: boolean
  }
  class FaiPointsLedgerEntry <<@Entity>> {
    userId: UUID
    delta: int
    actionCode: String
    refType / refId: String
    idempotencyKey: String «único»
    countsLifetime: boolean
    createdAt: Instant
  }
  class FlairCoinEntry <<@Entity>> {
    user: User
    delta: int
    reason / ref: String
  }
  class FlairMatch <<@Entity>> {
    id: UUID
    mode: String
    winnerSide: String
  }
}

FlairService --> FaiPointsService : game(FLAIR_DUEL | FLAIR_ARENA | FLAIR_TEAM)\naward(FLAIR_QUEST · GAME_WON)
FlairModesService --> FaiPointsService : game(FLAIR_<MODO>)
FlairModesService --> FlairService : award (coins)
ChallengeService --> FaiPointsService : game(CHALLENGE)\naward(CHALLENGE_COMPLETED)
Model3dService --> FaiPointsService : awardIsolated(PIECE_3D)
SchemeService ..> SchemeSaved : publica
WardrobeService ..> PieceCreated : publica
WardrobeService ..> PieceUpdated : publica
WardrobeEventListeners ..> SchemeSaved
WardrobeEventListeners ..> PieceCreated
WardrobeEventListeners ..> PieceUpdated
WardrobeEventListeners --> FaiPointsService : award(SCHEME_CREATED ·\nPIECE_CATALOGED · PIECE_COMPLETED)
WardrobeEventListeners ..> InventoryScoreService : catalogReady
FaiPointsService ..> Award
FaiPointsService --> FaiPointsRule : lê
FaiPointsService --> FaiPointsLedgerEntry : grava
FaiPointsRule "1" -- "0..*" FaiPointsLedgerEntry : actionCode
FlairService --> FlairCoinEntry : FLAIR Coins (moeda separada)
FlairService --> FlairMatch

note bottom of FaiPointsRule
  Regras do RF41:
  GAME_PLAYED 5 (6/dia) · GAME_WON 10 (4/dia)
  · FLAIR_QUEST 10 (3/dia) — V26
  SCHEME_CREATED 40 (5/dia) · PIECE_CATALOGED 25 (10/dia)
  · PIECE_COMPLETED 10 · PIECE_3D 15 · CHALLENGE_COMPLETED
  (valor do desafio) — V5
end note
note bottom of FaiPointsLedgerEntry
  idempotencyKey = userId:actionCode:refId
  ex.: …:GAME_PLAYED:FLAIR_DUEL:<partida>
  (a mesma partida nunca paga duas vezes)
end note
note bottom of FlairCoinEntry
  tabela flair_coin_entries: FLAIR Coins são
  outra moeda (só do jogo); nunca viram FAI Points
end note
@enduml
